    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's not just the paperwork. it's everyone. if the people who are supposed to help me don't even acknowledge me, how am i supposed to keep trying? it feels like there's no point in even being here if the world is just gonna keep grinding you down until there's nothing left. u feel like you're fighting a war you've already lost.",
